    "content": "<div class=\"ml-en\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IAM302 · Material pack</span>\n<h2>The student material pack</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">25 pdf · 7 pptx · 1 ppt · 1 txt. Slides are shown in the lessons above; the other files are downloaded inside FLM with your FPT account.</p></div>\n<div class=\"ml-vi\"><span class=\"eyebrow\">IAM302 · Gói tài liệu</span>\n<h2>Gói tài liệu sinh viên</h2>\n<p class=\"lead\">25 pdf · 7 pptx · 1 ppt · 1 txt. Slide đã gắn vào các bài phía trên; các tệp khác tải trong FLM bằng tài khoản FPT.</p></div>\n<table><thead><tr><th>File<br><small>Tệp</small></th><th>Type<br><small>Loại</small></th><th>Size<br><small>Dung lượng</small></th></tr></thead><tbody>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 1.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 10.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 11.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>2.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 12.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 13.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 16.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 18.1.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>4.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 18.2.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>4.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 2-3.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 4.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>2.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 5.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 6.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.7 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 7. docker.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>4.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 8.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/LAB 9.3 Disassembling C on Windows.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 14.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 15.1.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 15.2.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 17 Using Kernel Debugging Commands with WinDbg.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.1 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 19.1 Simple EXE Hacking with Immunity.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>4.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 19.2 EXE With Trojan Code in a New Section.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>3.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 9 Using Jasmin to run x86 Assembly Code.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>1.2 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Labs/Lab 9.1 IDA Pro.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 1. Intro.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.1 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 2. Fundamentals of Malware Analysis    .pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 3. Malware Classification.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.4 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 4. Malware Labs.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>1.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 5.1 .pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>0.8 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 5.2.ppt</td><td>ppt</td><td>1.9 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 6 Concise Intro_Python.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.3 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 7. Crash Course_Python.pdf</td><td>pdf</td><td>0.6 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 8. Malware Debugging.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.5 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Slide/Topic 9. Mem-Forensics.pptx</td><td>pptx</td><td>2.0 MB</td></tr>\n<tr><td>Link Tool IAM302.txt</td><td>txt</td><td>0.0 MB</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>"
